  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_0738.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(144 fotos) El Grupo Folkl&ograve;ric d&#39;Onda ha celebrat aquest dissabte la seua festa anual, amb desfilada des de l&#39;Ajuntament fins al carrer de Sant Joan, on han ofrenat flors a la seua patrona, Santa B&agrave;rbera, i despr&eacute;s a l&#39;esgl&egrave;sia Verge del Carme, on s&#39;ha celebrat missa cantada i ballada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0578.jpg\" alt=\"img_0578\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0579.jpg\" alt=\"img_0579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0580.jpg\" alt=\"img_0580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0581.jpg\" alt=\"img_0581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0582.jpg\" alt=\"img_0582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0583.jpg\" alt=\"img_0583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0584.jpg\" alt=\"img_0584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0585.jpg\" alt=\"img_0585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festagrupfolcloric2015/img_0586.jpg\" alt=\"img_0586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:au